<view class="page">
  <text class="h1">协议与隐私（测试稿）</text>
  <text class="muted">当前有效版本必须带版本号。正式文案仍待负责人确认。不开放生产真实注册或收款。</text>
  <view class="card">
    <text class="title">{{agreementTitle}} / {{agreementVersion}}</text>
    <scroll-view class="draft" scroll-y>
      <text class="muted">{{agreementText}}</text>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <text class="title">{{privacyTitle}} / {{privacyVersion}}</text>
    <scroll-view class="draft" scroll-y>
      <text class="muted">{{privacyText}}</text>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>
  <text class="muted">{{note}}</text>
  <button class="ghost" bindtap="goSupport">客服入口</button>
  <button class="ghost" bindtap="goDeletion">账号注销</button>
</view>
